Well, how many minotaur zombies or dragon zombies HAVE you come across?
There is no such thing as a "monster zombie" in Nethack. Only humanoinds can
be animated as "zombies", hence if you "resurrect" a monster, it will come
back as a monster of the same type. BUT if you zap the wand on a humanoid
corpse (which I assume all adventurers become since you will always revert
to your normal form before dying) it will be reanimated as a zombie.

At least this was the case in nh30j: 
Once, my pet dragon slew the only priest I had found in the whole game. No
problem, I thought and zapped my WoUT on the corpse... and got a human zombie
that was not too interested in receiving contributions or lowering my AC...

